%N A398358 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} (-1)^(k+1) * H(k,2) / (2*k+1), where H(k,2) = A007406(k)/A007407(k) is the k-th generalized harmonic number of order 2.
%H A398358 Ali Shadhar Olaikhan, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/373488370">An Introduction to the Harmonic Series and Logarithmic Integrals</a>, 2nd ed., 2023, section 4.5.3, pp. 332-333, eq. (4.127).
%H A398358 <a href="/index/Ha#harmonic">Index entries for sequences related to harmonic numbers</a>.
%F A398358 Equals 4*Im(Li_3(1+i)) - 5*Pi^3/48 - Pi*log(2)^2/4 - 2*log(2)*G, where i is the imaginary unit, and G is Catalan's constant (A006752).
%F A398358 Equals -4*Im(Li_3((1+i)/2)) + 11*Pi^3/96 + Pi*log(2)^2/8 - 2*log(2)*G.
%e A398358 0.191368427106631679889598556013362099706591080490453...
